      "hold": "The source synchronizes AON event requests to the core clock with prim_sync_reqack, registers per-event status in KEY_INTR_STATUS, and prim_intr_hw drives intr_event_detected_o as the INTR_STATE & INTR_ENABLE aggregate level.",
